                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4087d87e-a611-39d9-9639-98dba7d7968e",
                        "entry_id": "ac650135-a440-30c3-98f1-15b7716d06d7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "der untere Bereich des Bauches (unterm Bauchnabel)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "84904ec1-af7f-45b2-947a-45bafa9aedd1",
                                "sense_id": "4087d87e-a611-39d9-9639-98dba7d7968e",
                                "text": "Der Arzt untersuchte ihren Unterbauch."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49840d0a-0703-4f66-ae24-65a423c0954a",
                                "sense_id": "4087d87e-a611-39d9-9639-98dba7d7968e",
                                "text": "Über dem Unterbauch befindet sich der Oberbauch und darunter die Leiste(-ngegend)."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c160bd7b-4a30-4b5a-8986-dd67bcd0566f",
                        "source_entry_id": "ac650135-a440-30c3-98f1-15b7716d06d7",
                        "source_sense_id": "4087d87e-a611-39d9-9639-98dba7d7968e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Medizin, Anatomie: der untere Bereich des Bauches (unterm Bauchnabel)",
                        "target_lang_word": "lower abdomen",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "69856441-8498-4e82-9cc0-98dcbf342df0",
                        "source_entry_id": "ac650135-a440-30c3-98f1-15b7716d06d7",
                        "source_sense_id": "4087d87e-a611-39d9-9639-98dba7d7968e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Medizin, Anatomie: der untere Bereich des Bauches (unterm Bauchnabel)",
                        "target_lang_word": "underbelly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "underbelly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f067c868-a727-3bd0-9500-5d00ad047cd4",
                                        "entry_id": "a81f0acb-55f9-33d6-aa24-60f03e453ca8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The underside of an animal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12a12d1a-50b3-433a-973d-89736ae5a359",
                                                "sense_id": "f067c868-a727-3bd0-9500-5d00ad047cd4",
                                                "text": "We identified the species of the snake by its blue-grey underbelly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "710af5b2-00bb-42cc-ae62-36646d94b3ee",
                                                "sense_id": "f067c868-a727-3bd0-9500-5d00ad047cd4",
                                                "text": "The soft underbelly of the dragon. In the legend, the dragon's armor doesn't cover its stomach."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3a45c37-e4e1-44d1-932a-5ec4d3ce53ca",
                                                "sense_id": "f067c868-a727-3bd0-9500-5d00ad047cd4",
                                                "text": "The biologist and his team were greeted by a nonstop squid review, with Humboldt squid darting in toward the boat and flashing their underbellies in attempts to lure small schooling fish near the surface."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11bfb566-6cd8-36a9-a6bb-a8418bae0879",
                                        "entry_id": "a81f0acb-55f9-33d6-aa24-60f03e453ca8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The underside of any thing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a151a5d2-1173-4bc4-8b38-e4b1cc4206b1",
                                                "sense_id": "11bfb566-6cd8-36a9-a6bb-a8418bae0879",
                                                "text": "A jolt told me that the Nautilus had bumped the underbelly of the Ice Bank, still quite thick to judge from the hollowness of the accompanying noise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c7f67f2-493d-3aa1-ae18-7675e39ade0d",
                                        "entry_id": "a81f0acb-55f9-33d6-aa24-60f03e453ca8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The side which is not normally seen, normally a dark, immoral place."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1690a625-ef6c-4de0-adbe-1fcff7be5a6c",
                                                "sense_id": "4c7f67f2-493d-3aa1-ae18-7675e39ade0d",
                                                "text": "The area by the canal is the underbelly of town – not something you’d see in the guidebooks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3981546e-faac-4090-93ab-a9cdd997ddd7",
                                                "sense_id": "4c7f67f2-493d-3aa1-ae18-7675e39ade0d",
                                                "text": "In order to take the initiative, military leaders from Great Britain and the United States decided to attack in Africa, cross the Mediterranean, and move up against the \"soft underbelly\" of German-dominated Europe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "498a0e25-282c-498e-82d8-871a6a3fbb6d",
                                                "sense_id": "4c7f67f2-493d-3aa1-ae18-7675e39ade0d",
                                                "text": "The documents in this report reveal how such doctrinal disagreements have historically driven wedges within the upper echelons of al-Qa'ida. It is this intra-movement contention that comprises the soft underbelly of violent jihad, which can be exploited to great ends."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc3bf918-1bcb-44c1-b522-ab50de44f845",
                                                "sense_id": "4c7f67f2-493d-3aa1-ae18-7675e39ade0d",
                                                "text": "Twenty-one years after the movie \"Trainspotting\" gave the world a glimpse into Edinburgh's seedy, heroin-filled underbelly, the franchise is back on the map with “T2 Trainspotting.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d30dd275-dad5-421c-9713-bd2c63201cda",
                                                "sense_id": "4c7f67f2-493d-3aa1-ae18-7675e39ade0d",
                                                "text": "The book arrives at a moment of reckoning for the running world, as more female runners have come forward to share their stories of the sport’s dark underbelly, one that can be rife with manipulation, eating disorders and physical and emotional abuse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1ab935c1-190f-49d0-8b92-2708d440cd3f",
                        "source_entry_id": "ac650135-a440-30c3-98f1-15b7716d06d7",
                        "source_sense_id": "4087d87e-a611-39d9-9639-98dba7d7968e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Medizin, Anatomie: der untere Bereich des Bauches (unterm Bauchnabel)",
                        "target_lang_word": "bas-ventre",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bas-ventre",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50835f1d-d3cd-339f-88ca-310e5cbe2bb3",
                                        "entry_id": "15a2c50b-b2c0-3288-8359-5412bc309283",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partie inférieure du ventre qui correspond à la cavité du bassin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f656b40a-c28a-4399-8254-9fb8f7e2d10c",
                                                "sense_id": "50835f1d-d3cd-339f-88ca-310e5cbe2bb3",
                                                "text": "Quand M. le comte reçut son boulet dans le bas-ventre, je ramenai moi seul ses chevaux, ses mulets, sa tente et tout son équipage sans qu’il manquât un mouchoir, monsieur."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98197c87-4ac6-45b8-b684-b5bf951c0454",
                                                "sense_id": "50835f1d-d3cd-339f-88ca-310e5cbe2bb3",
                                                "text": "En revanche, son pied chaussé d’une tatane sans âge atteignit parfaitement son but : le bas-ventre de l’agresseur, qui se plia de douleur."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1fce089-c606-40d1-ac0b-b45b57c69f5d",
                                                "sense_id": "50835f1d-d3cd-339f-88ca-310e5cbe2bb3",
                                                "text": "— Les chambres, les greniers, les lieux de hauteur deviennent des thrènes murmurants tandis que la cave, bas-ventre tout en longueur de cette maison immense, est un poème des Enfers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fef2d562-d237-3cd8-8a50-c981ab9e47d9",
                                        "entry_id": "15a2c50b-b2c0-3288-8359-5412bc309283",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Parties génitales, sexe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "euphemism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1477b47-603a-48aa-b03c-1297268ab8a5",
                                                "sense_id": "fef2d562-d237-3cd8-8a50-c981ab9e47d9",
                                                "text": "« À lire le livre de M. Sorbier, on croirait que les maisons de Paris sont toutes mangées de lèpre et dégoulinantes de sueurs rouillées, que tous les cabinets sont bouchés, que tous les gosses ont la morve aux narines, que toutes les femmes vendent leur bas-ventre aux enchères et que tous les hommes sont des ivrognes conscients et organisés. »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26e021c5-e3eb-4868-b21b-6ffae2d25161",
                                                "sense_id": "fef2d562-d237-3cd8-8a50-c981ab9e47d9",
                                                "text": "Il se met debout, ventre et bas-ventre nus, se torche avec un bout de journal, regarde si les passants n’approchent pas, se torche une deuxième fois, inspecte son papier souillé, puis, hop ! recaleçonné, il franchit un muret et disparaît."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfa53b9a-03a6-45d5-9c79-cbe2d7ea1d7a",
                                                "sense_id": "fef2d562-d237-3cd8-8a50-c981ab9e47d9",
                                                "text": "Ce soir, le bas-ventre en feu dans son lit, il redevenait le petit scout hypocrite et libidineux hanté par l’envie de se tirer sur la nouille."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09f56791-5b96-43fd-b1ae-c6214d5b4cad",
                                                "sense_id": "fef2d562-d237-3cd8-8a50-c981ab9e47d9",
                                                "text": "Elle s’endort et même si je sens mon bas-ventre tout feu tout flamme, c’est mieux comme ça."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
